# {{class_name}}

A WolOS app made with Wolkit (see `docs/modules/wolkit.md` and `docs/modules/wolkit-tutorial.md`).

- `make run` builds and starts it; `make spec` runs the headless spec; `make check` only type-checks.
- `src/app.cr` is the entry point, `src/views/main.cr` the window, `src/components/` reusable parts,
  `src/styles/app.wolcss` the look, `assets/` pictures.
- `make styles` compiles the kit look and `src/styles/app.wolcss` together into `build/styles.wsb`; load it with `Wolkit.use_styles("build/styles.wsb")`. Without it every window has the default look.
- App id: `{{app_id}}`.
